<title>USA: Salomon names European mergers chief.</title>
<headline>Salomon names European mergers chief.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc said on Tuesday that it appointed Philip Keevil head of European mergers and acquisitions, based in London.</p>
<p>Keevil is a managing director in Salomon's mergers and acquisitions group in New York, the company said.</p>
<p>The name of Keevil's predecessor was not immediately available.</p>
